-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
 Aggregate  (cost=848.43..848.44 rows=1 width=8) (actual rows=1 loops=1)
   Buffers: shared hit=283
   ->  Index Scan using tenk1_idx_extra_column_in_middle on tenk1_dyn_saop  (cost=0.29..846.24 rows=875 width=0) (actual rows=500 loops=1)
         Index Cond: ((two = ANY ('{0,1}'::integer[])) AND (four >= ANY ('{1,2}'::integer[])) AND (twenty = ANY ('{0,1}'::integer[])))
         Buffers: shared hit=283
(5 rows)

