--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
 Index Scan using must_not_full_scan on redescend_test  (cost=0.29..837.23 rows=8999 width=16) (actual rows=9000 loops=1)
   Index Cond: ((district = ANY ('{1,3}'::integer[])) AND (orderid > 0) AND (orderid <= 150))
