   InitPlan 3 (returns $2)
     ->  Aggregate  (cost=6.28..6.29 rows=1 width=32) (actual rows=1 loops=1)
           ->  CTE Scan on range_ints range_ints_1  (cost=0.00..6.28 rows=1 width=4) (actual rows=5 loops=1)
                 Filter: ((i % 50) = 0)
                 Rows Removed by Filter: 246
   ->  Merge Join  (cost=0.55..54.58 rows=1 width=8) (actual rows=205 loops=1)
