   Recheck Cond: (foo = ANY ('{365,367}'::bigint[]))
   Heap Blocks: exact=1
   Buffers: shared hit=3
   ->  Bitmap Index Scan on opfamily_test_foo_idx  (cost=0.00..4.47 rows=23 width=0) (actual rows=2 loops=1)
         Index Cond: (foo = ANY ('{365,367}'::bigint[]))
